{"lines": ["How is Jesus connected to Mia Khalifa?", "In twenty sixteen, Pope Francis welcomed America's Secretary of State, John Kerry, to the Vatican.", "In twenty fourteen, Kerry visited the Washington Capitals locker room to send Alex Ovechkin off to the Olympics.", "And superfan Mia Khalifa, now a sports streamer, met her hero Ovechkin and gave him a custom Capitals shirt.", "How is Kim Jong Un connected to Mickey Mouse?", "In twenty eighteen, Kim Jong Un shook hands with Donald Trump in Singapore, the first summit between their two countries.", "Back in nineteen eighty-seven, real-estate developer Donald Trump met President Ronald Reagan at a White House reception.", "And in nineteen eighty-five, after cold weather cancelled his inaugural parade, Reagan held it at Epcot, with Mickey Mouse.", "How is Chris Pratt connected to Joseph Stalin?", "In twenty twenty-five, Chris Pratt joined his father-in-law, Arnold Schwarzenegger, at the premiere of FUBAR.", "In nineteen eighty-four, Arnold, already famous as the Terminator, met President Ronald Reagan at the Republican convention.", "In nineteen eighty-one, Reagan posed with Richard Nixon at the White House before Nixon flew to Sadat's funeral.", "In nineteen sixty-nine, Nixon visited Harry Truman in Missouri and played him a song on the piano.", "And in nineteen forty-five, Truman met Joseph Stalin at the Potsdam Conference to decide the fate of postwar Europe."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.34], ["is", 0.34, 0.52], ["Jesus", 0.52, 0.78], ["connected", 0.78, 1.3], ["to", 1.3, 1.6], ["Mia", 1.6, 1.8], ["Khalifa?", 1.8, 2.22], ["In", 3.22, 3.28], ["2016,", 3.28, 3.76], ["Pope", 4.18, 4.28], ["Francis", 4.28, 4.64], ["welcomed", 4.64, 5.02], ["America's", 5.02, 5.64], ["Secretary", 5.64, 5.86], ["of", 5.86, 6.18], ["State", 6.18, 6.4], ["John", 6.4, 6.74], ["Kerry", 6.74, 7.02], ["to", 7.02, 7.36], ["the", 7.36, 7.44], ["Vatican.", 7.44, 7.68], ["In", 8.26, 8.34], ["2014,", 8.34, 8.62], ["Kerry", 8.86, 9.54], ["visited",